        <title>SkyPaste Updates</title>
        
        <item>
            <title>Version 1.1</title>
            <pubDate>Sat, 24 Oct 2026 14:37:12 +0000</pubDate>
            <description><![CDATA[
<ul>
<li>Significantly smoother list scrolling when browsing large clipboard histories.</li>
<li>Optimized hover tracking and eliminated full-list re-renders during mouse movement.</li>
<li>Added caching for thumbnail existence checks, file directory checks, and application display names to prevent main thread hitches.</li>
<li>Fixed Library window appearing off-screen when opened from the status bar menu.</li>
<li>Adopted native macOS Liquid Glass styling and system dialogs.</li>
</ul>
            ]]></description>
