        </item>

        <item>
            <title>Version 1.0.9</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 01 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
            <description><![CDATA[
<p><b>⚠️ INSTALL MANUALLY — AUTO-UPDATE IS UNAVAILABLE FOR THIS RELEASE.</b><br/>
The update signing key had to be replaced, so versions 1.0.8 and older cannot verify or install this update automatically. Download <b>SkyPaste.zip</b> from the release page, quit SkyPaste and replace <b>/Applications/SkyPaste.app</b> manually, then re-grant Accessibility permission if you use Auto-Paste. Automatic updates work again starting from 1.0.9.</p>
<ul>
<li>Native Liquid Glass UI on macOS 26 and macOS 27 (with fallback on older systems).</li>
<li>macOS 27 SDK support and Sparkle 2.10.0.</li>
<li>Fixed a stray empty "Settings" window appearing on launch.</li>
<li>Fixed sharp square corners around the glass panels.</li>
<li>Pinned items are now clearly highlighted and adapt to light/dark appearance.</li>
<li>Improved Universal Clipboard reliability.</li>
<li>New Backup: export and import history, folders and pinned items from Settings &gt; Storage.</li>
</ul>
            ]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/sasaiber/SkyPaste/releases/download/1.0.9/SkyPaste.zip"
